# Dawn of a New Age enters with a hope counter for each creature you control: with an Ornithopter that is one. At the
# beginning of Bot1's end step the counter comes off, Bot1 draws a card, and with none left the enchantment is
# sacrificed and Bot1 gains 4 life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Dawn of a New Age
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x16

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
